  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"2.6.5\"\n\npackage:\n  name: cdo\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url:\n    - https://code.mpimet.mpg.de/attachments/download/30247/cdo-${{ version }}.tar.gz\n    # backup in case above is down\n    - https://mirror.spack.io/_source-cache/archive/bb/bbb58a519b463aa54477346794754a9936f2f09059a83fa9c82e76f1a13a5caf.tar.gz\n  sha256: bbb58a519b463aa54477346794754a9936f2f09059a83fa9c82e76f1a13a5caf\n\nbuild:\n  number: 2\n  skip: win\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib(\"c\") }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('fortran') }}\n    - if: unix\n      then: gnuconfig\n    - if: osx\n      then: llvm-openmp\n    - if: unix\n      then: make\n    - python >=3.6  # for make check; a version constraint keeps it out of the build matrix\n  host:\n    - if: osx\n      then: llvm-openmp\n    - jasper\n    - libcurl\n    - libnetcdf\n    - hdf5\n    - proj\n    - eccodes\n    - libuuid\n    - udunits2\n    - libxml2-devel\n    - fftw\n    - magics\n  run:\n    - if: osx\n      then: llvm-openmp\n    - jasper\n    - libcurl\n    - libnetcdf\n    - hdf5\n    - proj\n    - eccodes\n    - libuuid\n    - udunits2\n    - libxml2-devel\n    - fftw\n    - magics\n\ntests:\n  - files:\n      recipe:\n        - dummy.nc\n    script:\n      - cdo -V\n      - cdo -sinfo dummy.nc\n      - cdo -graph,device=png,linewidth=1 -settaxis,2000-01-01,12:00:00,1days -expr,'t=sin(seq*3.141529/180.0)' -for,1,6000 t\n\nabout:\n  license: BSD-3-Clause\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  summary: CLI tools to manipulate and analyse Climate and NWP model Data\n  homepage: https://code.mpimet.mpg.de/projects/cdo\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - zklaus\n    - akrherz\n    - Try2Code\n    - ocefpaf\n",
